  "user": "Please look up transaction TX-0401 in my account records and verify its amount. Then explain which reason codes could apply; I have not yet told you what happened.",
  "answer": "I found transaction **TX-0401** on your account ACC-1005 and verified the amount:\n\n- **Merchant:** TechMart Online\n- **Date:** 2026-07-20\n- **Amount:** EUR 240.00 (outgoing card payment)\n- **Status:** Settled\n\nI also see another transaction with the same merchant and amount: **TX-0402**, EUR 240.00 on 2026-07-14, also settled. If you did not intend to make both payments, that matters for the reason codes below.\n\nHere are the reason codes that could apply. Which one fits depends on what happened:\n\n1. **duplicate_charge**: You were charged more than once for the same purchase. This could fit if TX-0401 and TX-0402 are two charges for one order.\n2. **fraud_card_not_present**: You did not authorize a card payment made without the physical card, such as an online purchase. This could fit if you do not recognise TechMart Online as a payment you made.\n3. **unauthorized_debit**: Money was taken from your account without your authorisation. This could fit if someone else initiated the payment.\n4. **goods_not_received**: You paid for something and did not receive it.\n5. **service_not_rendered**: You paid for a service that was not provided.\n\nPlease tell me what happened. I will then check whether a dispute can be opened under the right code before taking any action. I will not open one without your confirmation.",
